  "label": {
    "en": [
      "A vintage black-and-white postcard depicting a busy urban square with a large, ornate building in the center. There are horse-drawn carriages, people, and an early electric tram visible in the scene. The top right of the card has the printed text 'Place de la Liberté.' There is a green postage stamp with Ottoman script, and a date is handwritten at the bottom right (1909)."
    ]
